owasp\-a10 \- Mishandling of Exceptional Conditions (OWASP Top 10:2025 A10)
.SH RANK
OWASP Top 10:2025 rank \fB#10\fR (new in 2025).
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unusual conditions are not prevented, not detected, or handled by failing open: sensitive error messages, NULL dereference, missing parameter, insufficient privileges ignored.
